Kahaa Roke Baqir Ne Aabid Se Baba ...<br />
<br />
1. Haan Dekha Hai Maine Safar Mai Yeh Manzar<br />
Jahaan Paani Hota Tha Is Ko Mayassar<br />
Toh Khud Apne Hisse Ka Paani Hamesha<br />
Giraati Thi Yeh Aap Ki Bediyon Par<br />
Mayassar Hai Ab Hamko Paani Toh Pyaasa<br />
Sakina Ko Kyu Chhod Kar Jaa Rahe Hai<br />
<br />
<br />
2. Jhukaaye Huwe Apna Sar Rorahi Hai<br />
Rihaai Ki Sunkar Khabar Rorahi Hai<br />
Tadapti Hai Dadi Rubab Aise Baba<br />
Ke Amma Bhi Thaame Jigar Rorahi Hai<br />
Batayenge Kya Gar Unhone Ye Puchha<br />
Sakina Ko Kyun Chhor Kar Jaa Rahe Hai<br />
<br />
3. Mujhe Yaad Hai Khud Yeh Kehte The Daada<br />
Madina Hai Iss Ke Sabab Se Madina<br />
Ke Meri Nazar Mai Woh Ghar Ghar Nahi Hai<br />
Nazar Jis Mai Aaye Na Mujhko Sakina<br />
Na Iss Ke Siwa Phir Basega Madina<br />
Sakina Ko Kyu Chhod Kar Jaa Rahe Hai<br />
<br />
4. Madina Ho Ya Shaam Karbobala Ho<br />
Ke Bazaaro Darbaar Ka Marhalaa Ho<br />
Sadaa Har Sitam Ham Ne Jhelaa Hai Milkar<br />
Toh Phir Kyun Na Yeh Mere Dil Ki Sadaa Ho<br />
Mujhe Bhi Yahin Chhod jana Ay Baba<br />
Sakina Ko Kyu Chhod Kar Jaa Rahe Hai<br />
<br />
5. Mujhe Aaj Yaad Aaraha Hai Woh Lamha<br />
Giri Thi Jo Naaqe Se Ik Din Sakina<br />
Lage Aap Ki Pusht Par Taaziyaane<br />
Magar Aapne Qaafila Rok-ke Rakhaa<br />
Rukaale Yuhin Qaafila Aaj Baba<br />
Sakina Ko Kyu Chhod Kar Jaa Rahe Hai<br />
<br />
6. Achaanak Nigaahe Padi Jo Lahad Par<br />
Sawaalaat Phir Lab Pe Aaye Na Akbar<br />
Sakina Ki Turbat Ko Sine Lagaaye<br />
Padar Se Yeh Kehne Lage Roke Baqir<br />
Samajh Mai Meri Ab Hai Baba Yeh Aaya<br />
Sakina Ko Kyu Chhod Kar Jaa Rahe Hai..(3)<br />
